Adqj8N3FXGkTyPjZHpFSX2SPuZiJfSvx8M57zQw2o6qDl2A_FvWIjF7csu2UA7f1JJQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOWUauE8o5zSzuwzsnrH3ys_ctxynBbgxFt3sL8vZZaiQ&oe=6AE4BACA"}, {"file_name": "new5.png", "id": "929092846369300", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618103_929092849702633_4288377025144767781_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wxr_KgZ26lcQ7kNvwFGfL_j&_nc_oc=Adov8ewrh27Z1-cbE9BRElTxQjV_Upgr5KmgAx2fgy9-6svgla_VdXNahl1S5Z-xKfQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPPewbDB_Xzh7BeSaLgMz8BltJFc4gyafYzedSTTB3WKw&oe=6AE49B44"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "ver 3.png", "id": "6375608295894917", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982600_6375608302561583_3516310550568960282_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wdn3A7akgrQQ7kNvwGK5jkz&_nc_oc=AdrAf4uckwUVY2l3KI8RRVFZ9egNTVW0E5R_pLXJAPRPpHEfYW5Po2TghLUqXqRLIjg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQO6D17XEahsdnFmecM2wmqaX0oesbL1b3R50fLHm6jpaQ&oe=6AE4B715"}, "display_name": "Figmin XR | Mixed Reality", "keywords": ["art", "AR", "MixedReality", "TiltBrush", "spatial"], "long_description": "\ud83c\udfc6 Mixed Reality App of the Year \ud83c\udfc6 - UploadVR 2024 & 2025\n\n# Create, Collect, & Play: The Ultimate Mixed Reality Experience!\n\nFigmin XR is a fun spatial computing application that lets you easily create, collect & play in mixed reality. With an intuitive interface and multiplayer, anything you imagine can come to life! \n\nDecorate your room with stunning 3D models, create games and immersive educational experiences, dive into storytelling, art, and visualization projects. With Scripting and AI Agent support, you can go beyond scenes and experiences to build full spatial computing apps.\n\n**Built-In Tools:**\n\n\ud83c\udfa8 3D Sketching: Powered by Tilt Brush!\n\n\ud83c\udf10 Web Browser Integration: Extract images and models to view in 3D space and create web apps.\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Search and Import: Add 3D models, animated GIFs, and videos to your projects\n\n\u270d\ufe0f 3D Text Editor: Design and display text in your virtual world\n\n\ud83d\udcbb Scripting support: Learn more www.figmin.com/api\n\n\ud83e\udd16 AI Agent: Connect your AI assistant to work with you live inside Figmin XR! Learn more www.figmin.com/ai\n\n\ud83c\udfae Physics Editor: Bring your creations to life with real-world physics.\n\n\ud83c\udfa5 Motion Editor: Animate objects simply by moving them around\n\n\ud83d\udca1 Lighting Editor: Illuminate the real world with advanced lighting controls.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f Group, Trail & Voxel Editors\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Content Discovery: Explore Figmin XR\u2019s user-generated content and publish your own.\n\n\ud83d\udd8c\ufe0f Logitech MXInk support\n\n**Supported Formats for Web Content Extraction:**\n- Images: PNG, JPG, GIF, WebP\n- 3D Models: GLB", "short_description": "Create, Collect, & Play with Figmin XR: The Ultimate Mixed Reality Experience!\n\nFigmin XR is a fun spatial computing application that empowers you to create, collect, and play in mixed reality. Whether you're an artist, gamer, educator, or simply curious, Figmin XR opens the door to endless possibilities. With support for multiplayer, Scripting & AI agents anything you imagine can come to life!"}]}, "developer_name": "Overlay", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.figmin.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.figmin.com/terms", "publisher_name": "Overlay", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.overlaymr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1725996564472128"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "EDUCATIONAL", "UTILITY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connectio